The '''Gold Coast Quarry''' used to be a valuable mineral and gold mine in [[Westfall]] for the [[Stormwind (kingdom)|kingdom of Stormwind]]. Now, however, the quarry is in the hands of the [[Defias Brotherhood]] and their agents patrol the area.

